{"3650740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dig & Deal", "steam_appid": 3650740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/18d1aefbd59702f6c39b332fd1a4fe28.avif?t=1786561326\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras_big/18d1aefbd59702f6c39b332fd1a4fe28.webp?t=1786561326 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1786561326\" width=320 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1786561326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1786561326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Dig Harder Deal Smarter...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig and Deal</strong> is a <strong>digging</strong> and <strong>trading</strong> simulator where you run your own shop by selling the treasures you uncover underground. <strong>Dig, explore, collect valuable items, and make deals with your customers to grow your fortune!</strong> Buy better tools, dig deeper, discover rarer loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/8c7ad463ff82abb5dc939de76d872a63.avif?t=1786561326\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/d35ea368deb92542f1ac5d0092eeb819.poster.avif?t=1786561326\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/d35ea368deb92542f1ac5d0092eeb819.webm?t=1786561326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/d35ea368deb92542f1ac5d0092eeb819.mp4?t=1786561326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig the terrain, find valuable items, upgrade your equipment, and dig even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/98769fc4a38d5bd8190ec774dacb2a33.avif?t=1786561326\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/aa057932ea5908dd020ba949a5dfaa31.poster.avif?t=1786561326\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/aa057932ea5908dd020ba949a5dfaa31.webm?t=1786561326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/aa057932ea5908dd020ba949a5dfaa31.mp4?t=1786561326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate prices</strong> with customers to get the <strong>best possible deals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https