orate and upgrade your shop</strong> with furniture and props to improve its look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/4bd467e48b279a6d9a0a11d0fe62b6b5.avif?t=1786561326\" width=610 height=86 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1786561326\" width=320 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1786561326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1786561326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Dig Harder Deal Smarter...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig and Deal</strong> is a <strong>digging</strong> and <strong>trading</strong> simulator where you run your own shop by selling the treasures you uncover underground. <strong>Dig, explore, collect valuable items, and make deals with your customers to grow your fortune!</strong> Buy better tools, dig deeper, discover rarer loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/8c7ad463ff82abb5dc939de76d872a63.avif?t=1786561326\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extr